    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MALEE: Mom, I need help.\nYACCO: Any parent is \"parent of the year\" next to you, you selfish prick.",
      "DEBBIE: I don't think therapy is helping.\nYACCO: Why do you say that? Are you still \"cutting\"?\nDEBBIE: It feels much better than it looks. Really.\nMALEE: Ma, I... Oops.",
      "MALEE: Why do I have to do this? It's Christmas break.\nYACCO: You'll be one step ahead in January.\nMALEE: Just because you're an atheist, I don't get to celebrate the holidays.\nMALEE: Don't you find it hard not believing in anything?",
      "YACCO: Malee, dinner!\nYACCO: Malee? Oh my God!\nYACCO: What did you do?\nMALEE: I got a new look. You know, for Spring. What do you think?"
    ]
  },
